{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://github.com/velazcod/oc-dynamic-workflows/assets/workflow.schema.json",
  "title": "opencode dynamic workflow spec",
  "description": "A spec is JSON with \"specVersion\": 1, \"name\", \"goal\", and \"phases\".\nA phase has \"id\", \"strategy\" (\"sequential\", \"parallel\", or \"team\"), \"tasks\", and an optional \"synthesisPrompt\".\nA task has \"id\", \"kind\" (\"agent\" with a \"prompt\", or \"shell\" with a \"command\"), and optional \"agent\", \"retries\" (0-3), \"timeoutMs\", \"outputSchema\", \"isolation\", and \"keep\".\nSet the model on the agent: \"model\" on a task is rejected. A role takes its model from the plugin options.\nThe plugin registers one read-only agent per role: reviewer, security-reviewer, researcher, stakeholder, synthesizer. Name one with \"agent\" on a task; it reads and reports and never edits.\n\"isolation\": \"worktree\" runs the task in its own git worktree of HEAD; edits are saved as a patch and the worktree is removed unless \"keep\": true.\nA \"sequential\" phase can carry \"repeat\": { \"gate\": <task id>, \"maxRounds\": 1-5 }: the gate is the last task of the phase and answers one JSON object with \"approved\" and \"findings\"; a round the gate refuses runs the whole phase again with the findings in the prompt.\nA \"team\" phase runs like \"parallel\" and opens the mailbox: its members use team_send, and you use team_steer and team_inbox.\nThree workflows are built in: build-review, secure-build, and plan-research. Run one with workflow_run_saved, a \"name\" and a \"goal\", instead of writing a spec for a build or a plan.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "$schema": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "specVersion": {
      "type": "number",
      "const": 1
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "goal": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "budget": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "usd": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0.01,
          "maximum": 1000
        },
        "tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1000,
          "maximum": 50000000
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "phases": {
      "minItems": 1,
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "strategy": {
            "default": "parallel",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "sequential",
              "parallel",
              "team"
            ]
          },
          "tasks": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "kind": {
                  "default": "agent",
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "agent",
                    "shell"
                  ]
                },
                "prompt": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "command": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "agent": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "model": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "retries": {
                  "default": 0,
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "maximum": 3
                },
                "timeoutMs": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 5000,
                  "maximum": 1800000
                },
                "isolation": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "worktree"
                },
                "keep": {
                  "default": false,
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "outputSchema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "propertyNames": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "additionalProperties": {}
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "id"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "synthesisPrompt": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "mailbox": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "peers": {
                "default": false,
                "type": "boolean",
                "const": false
              },
              "maxMessages": {
                "default": 20,
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 50
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "repeat": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "gate": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "maxRounds": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 5
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "gate",
              "maxRounds"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "tasks"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "specVersion",
    "name",
    "goal",
    "phases"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
